 * aligned `.gitattributes`, `.gitignore`, `LICENSE` and `phpunit.xml.dist` with the template, mostly missing trailing newlines
 * squashed the eight commits into one and set the header table to 8.2

One fix outside the bridge: `FrameworkExtension.php` was missing a space after a comma on the `Prelude` line. That is pre-existing, but Fabbot lints every file a PR touches, so it would have failed here.

The bridge suite is green, and so is the `UnsupportedSchemeException` test that enumerates every scheme.

